        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana POM70, Large Modern Pommel Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Pommel Cabinet Pull measures 9 inches overall with 7 inch mounting centers. It comes packaged with all the hardware you'll need to install it during your modern kitchen remodel. The Large Modern Pommel Cabinet Door Pull is available in a wide array of popular finish colors. This contemporary kitchen cabinet pull is a great choice to modernize any lightweight door or drawer. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-POM70-specifications.gif?v=1704354569\" width=\"600\" height=\"179\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana POM70 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/small-pommel-cabinet-pull-deltana-pom40\"><b>Deltana POM40 Small Pommel Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-POM70-installed.jpg?v=1704354569\" width=\"307\" height=\"278\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana POM70 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern 7 Inch Pommel Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Thickness: 7/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Mount Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-POM70-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Deltana POM70 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
